I've left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`. Writing to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` needs a filesystem capability, and calling `metadata.internal.example` needs an HTTP capability. Adding either import would widen the node's authority beyond what the graph declares. The enrichment call would also send each user question to an external host, so it needs its own grant and review. Operations should request a logging capability and an HTTP capability scoped to that host in a separate node, or have the host do this logging.

